# Pairs with RevocationTakesEffect. Returning before the captured peer was
# told or waited out acknowledges a revocation the peer has not seen.
MODULE: CompleteBeforeEveryAck
TARGET: RevocationTakesEffect
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the write returns covered while the peer is still captured
PERTURBS: Complete

--- FIND
    /\ ~captured
--- REPLACE
    /\ TRUE
--- END